{"3943720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shelf by Shelf: Bookstore Simulator", "steam_appid": 3943720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>All kinds of shelves, colorful books, and a warm little shop!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shelf by Shelf is a cozy simulation game that blends the love of books with a relaxing organizing experience. Arrange books on shelves, sort them by genre, and decorate your store. Spending time in a tidy and warm bookshop will make you feel great!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943720/extras/37c8588b2ca1380883e8f2f6b4b73ee1.poster.avif?t=1786488693\" width=800 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943720/extras/37c8588b2ca1380883e8f2f6b4b73ee1.webm?t=1786488693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943720/extras/37c8588b2ca1380883e8f2f6b4b73ee1.mp4?t=1786488693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Awaits You in Shelf by Shelf?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦆 <strong>A Place for Everything</strong><br>Whether it’s colorful books with vibrant covers or your personal items, organize your shelves just the way you like. Fill them up, enrich your collection, and create libraries that appeal to every reader!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📚 <strong>From Dusty Shelves to Grand Libraries</strong><br>Start with a cozy reading corner and grow into a bustling bookstore filled to the brim. Expand your space with new furniture, decorations, and collections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💭 <strong>Requests Come In, You Deliver</strong><br>From local residents to book clubs, fulfill orders for different customers, prepare special collections, and invest your earnings back into your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏢 <strong>Your Shop, Your Style</strong><br>Colorful covers, elegant furniture, and character-filled decorations… All the details to make your bookstore unique are in your hands!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943720/extras/5ec52bc7c2b05f6947a45989938a61e5.poster.avif?t=1786488693\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943720/extras/5ec52bc7c2b05f6947a45989938a61e5.webm?t=1786488693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943720/extras/5ec52bc7c2b05f6947a45989938a61e5.mp4?t=1786488693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Soft-toned, warm, and comforting visuals<br>✔ Relaxing and smooth organizing mechanics<br>✔ Carefully selected literary works to expand your general knowledge<br>✔ A gameplay pace that soothes rather than stresses<br>✔ Hidden little surprises waiting to be discovered</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>Shelf by Shelf</strong> to your wishlist so you can be the first to fill those shelves!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>All kinds of shelves, colorful books, and a warm little shop!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shelf by Shelf is a cozy simulation game that blends the love of books with a relaxing organizing experience. Arrange books on shelves, sort them by genre, and decorate your store. Spending time in a tidy and warm bookshop will make you feel great!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943720/extras/37c8588b2ca1380883e8f2f6b4b73ee1.poster.avif?t=1786488693\" width=800 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943720/extras/37c8588b2ca1380883e8f2f6b4b73ee1.webm?t=1786488693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943720/extras/37c8588b2ca1380883e8f2f6b4b73ee1.mp4?t=1786488693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Awaits You in Shelf by Shelf?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦆 <strong>A Place for Everything</strong><br>Whether it’s colorful books with vibrant covers or your personal items, organize your shelves just the way you like. Fill them up, enrich your collection, and create libraries that appeal to every reader!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📚 <strong>From Dusty Shelves to Grand Libraries</strong><br>Start with a cozy reading corner and grow into a bustling bookstore filled to the brim. Expand your space with new furniture, decorations, and collections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💭 <strong>Requests Come In, You Deliver</strong><br>From local residents to book clubs, fulfill orders for different customers, prepare special collections, and invest your earnings back into your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏢 <strong>Your Shop, Your Style</strong><br>Colorful covers, elegant furniture, and character-filled decorations… All the details to make your bookstore unique are in your hands!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943720/extras/5ec52bc7c2b05f6947a45989938a61e5.poster.avif?t=1786488693\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943720/extras/5ec52bc7c2b05f6947a45989938a61e5.webm?t=1786488693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943720/extras/5ec52bc7c2b05f6947a45989938a61e5.mp4?t=1786488693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Soft-toned, warm, and comforting visuals<br>✔ Relaxing and smooth organizing mechanics<br>✔ Carefully selected literary works to expand your general knowledge<br>✔ A gameplay pace that soothes rather than stresses<br>✔ Hidden little surprises waiting to be discovered</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>Shelf by Shelf</strong> to your wishlist so you can be the first to fill those shelves!</p>", "short_description": "Work in a warm, cozy bookstore, sort books by genre, and brighten your shelves! Shelf by Shelf invites you into a peaceful world with satisfying organizing mechanics. Help local readers find the perfect books, make them happy, grow your earnings, and expand your shop!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Shelf by Shelf provides a peaceful experience through its relaxing atmosphere, gameplay, and premise. Overall, it’s a game that feels like curling up with a good book.”<br>LadiesGamers<br><br>“Express your style through decorating and help customers find the perfect book by fulfilling their requests.”<br>Comfy Cozy Gaming<br><br>“Its concept of managing a bookstore filled with colour-coded shelves and personalized touches appeals to players seeking something peaceful and creative.”<br>DP Simulation<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943720/92176b34557e406d7ba4df8db6a07e21a6db6235/header.jpg?t=1786488693", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.